subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Manage filter profiles

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [profile] <OPTIONS>       Manage filter profiles
  delete <OPTIONS>          Delete a profile
  list <OPTIONS>            List saved profiles
  save <OPTIONS>            Save a filter profile
  show <OPTIONS>            Show profile details
  switch <OPTIONS>          Switch to a saved profile

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack profile --help
  subtrack profile delete --help
  subtrack profile list --help
  subtrack profile save --help
  subtrack profile show --help
  subtrack profile switch --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

